# Historical prologue chapter 1
#: src/story/lore_books.py:50
msgid ""
"Long ago, before the twin moons shattered in the northern sky, the realm was united under the banner of the Sun King.\n"
"Now only dust and crumbling monoliths remain to tell the tale of an empire swallowed by forgotten shadows."
msgstr ""
"很久以前，在双月于北方天空碎裂之前，整个王国曾统一在太阳王的旗帜之下。\n"
"如今只剩下尘土与崩塌的巨石，诉说着一个被遗忘阴影吞噬的帝国的故事。"

# Legend of Mount Ignis
#: src/story/lore_books.py:62
msgid ""
"The ancient dragon slumbered beneath Mount Ignis for three centuries, bound by enchanted silver chains.\n"
"With each passing earthquake, the runes weaken, and molten whispers echo through the cavernous depths."
msgstr ""
"远古巨龙在伊格尼斯山下沉睡了三个世纪，被附魔的银色锁链束缚。\n"
"随着每一次地震，符文逐渐削弱，熔岩般的低语在洞穴深处回荡。"

# Alchemical Codex Recipe
#: src/story/lore_books.py:74
msgid ""
"To brew the Draught of Eternal Clarity, an alchemist must distill morning dew gathered from silver lilies.\n"
"Combine the extract over a steady blue flame and stir clockwise thrice before adding crushed starstone."
msgstr ""
"要酿造永恒清明药剂，炼金术士必须蒸馏从银百合上采集的晨露。\n"
"在稳定的蓝色火焰上混合提取物，顺时针搅拌三次，然后加入碎星石。"

# Urgent military dispatch letter
#: src/story/lore_books.py:86
msgid ""
"Dear Commander,\n"
"Our scouts report overwhelming enemy troop concentrations assembling along the western ridgeline.\n"
"If reinforcements do not arrive before nightfall, the fortress cannot hold another siege."
msgstr ""
"亲爱的指挥官，\n"
"我们的斥候报告，大批敌军正在西部山脊沿线集结。\n"
"如果援军在夜幕降临前仍未抵达，要塞将无法抵御下一次围攻。"

# Historical treatise on the lost archives
#: src/story/lore_books.py:98
msgid ""
"The Great Library of Alexandria contained thousands of scrolls chronicling celestial geometry and lost magics.\n"
"When the great fire consumed its halls, only the secretive Keepers preserved the arcane scrolls in deep vaults."
msgstr ""
"亚历山大图书馆曾藏有数千卷记录天体几何与失落魔法的卷轴。\n"
"当大火吞噬其殿堂时，只有隐秘的守护者将奥术卷轴保存在深层金库中。"

# Citadel emergency proclamation
#: src/story/lore_books.py:110
msgid ""
"Notice of Evacuation:\n"
"All residents living within the lower harbor district must relocate to the upper citadel immediately.\n"
"The rising tidal surges and monster incursions pose severe threats to civilian safety."
msgstr ""
"疏散通知：\n"
"所有居住在下港区的居民必须立即迁往上城要塞。\n"
"不断上涨的潮涌与怪物入侵对平民安全构成严重威胁。"

# Miner's discarded diary excerpt
#: src/story/lore_books.py:122
msgid ""
"Whoever reads this final diary entry, know that we did not succumb to despair willingly.\n"
"Water supplies ran dry on the fourteenth day after the cave-in, yet our faith in rescue never wavered."
msgstr ""
"无论谁读到这篇最后的日记，请知道我们并非心甘情愿地向绝望屈服。\n"
"在塌方后的第十四天，水源耗尽了，但我们对于获救的信念从未动摇。"

# Labyrinth trial description
#: src/story/lore_books.py:134
msgid ""
"In the deepest chamber of the labyrinth lies the Mirror of Truth.\n"
"It reflects neither beauty nor ugliness, but reveals the hidden fears and ambitions lurking in the beholder's heart."
msgstr ""
"在迷宫最深处的密室里，放置着真理之镜。\n"
"它既不映照美丽，也不映照丑陋，而是揭示观者心中潜藏的恐惧与野心。"

# Mercenary guild legal contract
#: src/story/lore_books.py:146
msgid ""
"Contract of the Mercenary Guild:\n"
"Clause 1: The contractor agrees to pay full bounty upon verified presentation of the beast's horn.\n"
"Clause 2: The guild bears no liability for injuries, curses, or fatalities sustained during the bounty hunt."
msgstr ""
"佣兵公会契约：\n"
"条款 1：在经核实出示野兽之角后，委托人同意支付全额赏金。\n"
"条款 2：公会不对赏金狩猎期间所受的伤害、诅咒或死亡承担任何责任。"

# Mythology of the Eclipse
#: src/story/lore_books.py:158
msgid ""
"When the eclipse covers the crimson sun, the gateway to the Netherworld opens for one brief hour.\n"
"Those who dare cross the threshold must return before the final ray vanishes, or remain wandering forever."
msgstr ""
"当蚀影遮蔽赤日，冥界之门将开启短短一小时。\n"
"胆敢跨过门槛者，必须在最后一道光芒消逝前返回，否则将永远徘徊。"
